    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2569590/extras/be0ce3cb981cfe3c5d5297b7c81d1fa6.poster.avif?t=1720692933\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2569590/extras/be0ce3cb981cfe3c5d5297b7c81d1fa6.webm?t=1720692933\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2569590/extras/be0ce3cb981cfe3c5d5297b7c81d1fa6.mp4?t=1720692933\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2569590/extras/160d5721b158a5fd965d0e67e341fbdc.avif?t=1720692933\" width=616 height=134 /></span><br><br>Step into the immersive world of Glix, a captivating 2.5D puzzle platformer set in a chilling dystopian future. Take control of a child who wants to uncover the secrets of the surroundings. Navigate through mysterious environments to solve the puzzles and overcome platform challenges, all while immersed in an atmosphere with tension.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2569590/extras/c153ee6d2acb0bf49063b46cf9452666.poster.avif?t=1720692933\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2569590/extras/c153ee6d2acb0bf49063b46cf9452666.webm?t=1720692933\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2569590/extras/c153ee6d2acb0bf49063b46cf9452666.mp4?t=1720692933\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Explore bizarre landscapes, witness surreal events, and encounter captivating character designs along the way. But beware, for the truth lies hidden beneath the surface, waiting to be unveiled. Dare to delve deeper into the enigmatic story, unlocking its mysteries one gummy candy at a time. Enter the world of Glix and embark on an unforgettable journey of discovery.<br><br><strong>FEATURES</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2569590/extras/e3b0105a33af6e3ac54ff35adf6cf775.poster.avif?t=1720692933\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2569590/extras/e3b0105a33af6e3ac54ff35adf6cf775.webm?t=1720692933\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2569590/extras/e3b0105a33af6e3ac54ff35adf6cf775.mp4?t=1720692933\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2569590/extras/4f0131681bb19c01dff795736ceefdc3.avif?t=1720692933\" width=616 height=134 /></span><br><br><strong>Story</strong><br>A biotech company runs an odd campaign through the world and changes everything. Embark on a journey navigating the fine line between imagination and reality.<br><br><strong>Cinematic Atmosphere</strong><br>Immerse yourself in a mysterious, cinematic world where the story unfolds through environmental storytelling.<br><br><strong>Puzzles</strong><br>Engage in solving puzzles through interactive environments and overcoming platform obstacles, all while embracing elements of stealth and curiosity.<br><br><strong>Sound</strong><br>Experience enhanced tension with realistic and atmospheric sound design, elevating the immersive atmospheric experience.",
